ideo/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KOLKATA, INDIA IS CALLING YOU AND YOUR FRIENDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends run a scam call center under a ruthless boss. Cleverly scam and manipulate AI callers with your schemes! Hack into their computers to access the personal information you desperately need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954910/extras/d3f0da7740a086432ec2ef22c6bbd919.poster.avif?t=1792556475\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954910/extras/d3f0da7740a086432ec2ef22c6bbd919.webm?t=1792556475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954910/extras/d3f0da7740a086432ec2ef22c6bbd919.mp4?t=1792556475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIT THE DAILY QUOTA OR FACE THE WRATH OF YOUR BOSS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day you progress, you expand your arsenal of scams. Scam innocent people out of their life savings to reach your daily quota or GET FIRED!!! It is you or them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954910/extras/6c7b46a91a7fccaf47f57178281a1c78.poster.avif?t=1792556475\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954910/extras/6c7b46a91a7fccaf47f57178281a1c78.webm?t=1792556475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954910/extras/6c7b46a91a7fccaf47f57178281a1c78.mp4?t=1792556475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE PRODUCTIVE! AND TRY NOT TO GET HACKED BY SCAMBAITERS...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused on scamming and try not get distracted. Watch out for the feisty <strong>scambaiters</strong> or you might catch the worst computer virus ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954910/extras/d2629c780e59c41ae116c021d0778fb4.poster.avif?t=1792556475\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954910/extras/d2629c780e59c41ae116c021d0778fb4.webm?t=1792556475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954910/extras/d2629c780e59c41ae116c021d0778fb4.mp4?t=1792556475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op with your friends or public lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hilarious real-time AI conversations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ridiculous scam scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run-based progression with increasingly chaotic workdays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remote access to victim computers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game paint app, screen recorder, and camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive computer viruses, police raids, air strikes, and other workplace disasters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavily moddable content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom personalities through JSON files and voice cloning WAV files</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (6 GB) / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["JakeHub","Metater"],"publishers":["Jatater Worldwide"],"release_date":"15 Oct, 2026"}